 "name_en": "Accounting and Financial Close – Group Ledger IFRS (1GA)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Accounting and Financial Close – Group Ledger IFRS (1GA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6219412f09134fa196d5c4ea068d71c2\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6219412f09134fa196d5c4ea068d71c2__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">General Ledger Accounting provides a comprehensive overview of external accounting and accounts and supports parallel accounting.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">General Ledger Accounting serves as a complete record of all business transactions, providing a centralized, up-to-date reference for the rendering of accounts. Actual individual transactions can be checked at any time in real-time processing by displaying the original documents, line items, and transaction figures at various levels to support parallel accounting. These transactions include:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Manage Journal Entries, Post with Clearing for Ledger Group, Run Automatic Clearing Specific to Ledger Groups, Trial Balance Comparison, and Financial Statement Ledger Comparison.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6219412f09134fa196d5c4ea068d71c2__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage journal entries</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain accounts: Automatic and manual clearing to ledger group</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform day-end, month-end, and year-end closing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6219412f09134fa196d5c4ea068d71c2__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Record all business transactions to ensure complete and accurate accounting data in parallel accounting</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>会计和财务关账 – 集团分类账 IFRS (1GA)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6219412f09134fa196d5c4ea068d71c2\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6219412f09134fa196d5c4ea068d71c2__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">总账会计提供外部会计和科目的全面概览，并支持并行会计。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">总账会计用作所有业务交易的完整记录，为呈现科目提供集中、最新的参考。通过在不同级别显示原始凭证、行项目和交易额，可以随时在实时处理中检查实际的单个交易，以支持并行会计。这些事务包括：</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">管理日记账分录、分类账组的清账过账、运行特定于分类账组的自动清账、试算表比较和财务报表分类账比较。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6219412f09134fa196d5c4ea068d71c2__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">管理日记账分录</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护科目：自动和手动清算到分类账组</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行日终、月末和年末关账</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6219412f09134fa196d5c4ea068d71c2__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">记录所有业务交易，以确保并行会计中会计数据的完整性和准确性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
